---
import Layout from '../layouts/PapaLayout.astro';
import PapaHero from '../components/PapaHero.astro';
---
<Layout>
	<PapaHero />

	<section class="section">
	<div class="container">

<h2 class="section-title">人気の記事</h2>

<div class="cards">

<article class="card">
    images/article1.jpg
    <div class="card-content">
        <h3>がんばりすぎない育児のすすめ</h3>
        <p>完璧なパパじゃなくていい。</p>
    </div>
</article>

<article class="card">
    images/article2.jpg
    <div class="card-content">
        <h3>家族の時間と副業を両立する</h3>
        <p>無理なく続けるコツ。</p>
    </div>
</article>

<article class="card">
    images/article3.jpg
    <div class="card-content">
        <h3>子どもの「今」を楽しむ</h3>
        <p>あとから振り返れば宝物。</p>
    </div>
</article>

</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="container">

<h2 class="section-title">カテゴリー</h2>

<div class="categories">

<div class="category">
    <div class="icon">🍼</div>
    <h3>子育て</h3>
</div>

<div class="category">
    <div class="icon">💼</div>
    <h3>仕事</h3>
</div>

<div class="category">
    <div class="icon">💻</div>
    <h3>副業</h3>
</div>

<div class="category">
    <div class="icon">☕</div>
    <h3>心を休める</h3>
</div>

<div class="category">
    <div class="icon">❤️</div>
    <h3>暮らし</h3>
</div>

</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="container">

<div class="message">

<h2>今日も、おつかれさま。</h2>

<p>
誰かと比べなくていい。<br>
家族を大切にしようとしているだけで十分すごい。<br>
この場所が、あなたの小さな休憩所になりますように。
</p>

</div>

</section>

</Layout>

<style>
.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:0 24px;
}
/* Popular */
.section{
    padding:80px 0;
}

.section-title{
    font-size:2rem;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:24px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

.card img{
    width:100%;
    height:220px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.card-content{
    padding:20px;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* Categories */
.categories{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    gap:20px;
}

.category{
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:24px;
    text-align:center;
}

.icon{
    font-size:2rem;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* Message */
.message{
    background:#f6ead4;
    padding:80px 20px;
    text-align:center;
    border-radius:32px;
}

.message h2{
    font-size:2.5rem;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){
	.cards{
		grid-template-columns:1fr;
	}
	.categories{
		grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
	}
}
</style>
